	(descr "GDEY0213B74 e-paper panel, display up, tail folded 180 degrees under the panel into a Hirose FH34SRJ-24S-0.5SH(50) (LCSC C324726). Pad n = panel pin n. Panel, its areas and the tail on Dwgs.User; the fold sticks out 4.8 mm past the panel edge. Assumes a 6 mm spacer under the panel (at least the connector height, 1.0 mm, plus clearance) and the bend 1.75 mm from the glass; the panel edge lands 1.1 mm from the connector origin, +-0.5 mm. Courtyard covers the connector and the tail, not the panel: parts under the panel must be lower than the spacer.")
